{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover a heartfelt story through the pages of a beautiful scrapbook.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sort through</strong> mementos and solve<strong> light puzzles</strong>\u00a0on every page to discover the real-life-inspired story of Connie and Beth\u2019s friendship.\u00a0Enjoy 1 to 2 hours of carefully crafted playtime full of emotional highs and lows - and plenty of cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/e229823dedc55de6388e5c1308dfd7c0.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1475 height=194 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/954220eca519436f38d369c5c728c9cf.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1476 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/a72cdd57f953e30debeb0e7be029b623.poster.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/a72cdd57f953e30debeb0e7be029b623.webm?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/a72cdd57f953e30debeb0e7be029b623.mp4?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet <strong>Connie</strong>, a 30-something looking back on a difficult time in her life: at 10 years old, her family was uprooted to the city, leaving her feeling <strong>lost and alon</strong>e. Just as she was at her lowest, <strong>a new friend</strong> came into the picture - <strong>bold, confident Beth</strong>! The were inseparable all through their school years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, it's been years since they spoke. Connie is using her scrapbook to sort through her memories, and her feelings, about this friendship from the past, penning an emotional letter to her former best friend as she goes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Connie needs to decide: does she want to reach out, or is the past best left behind?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/9d4d472c989bb04a977fc735ee5b0404.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1468 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/ff68c662bd37c45b1208ac92978656cf.poster.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/ff68c662bd37c45b1208ac92978656cf.webm?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/ff68c662bd37c45b1208ac92978656cf.mp4?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy a variety of scrapbooking activities and light puzzles - every page is unique!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find yourself doing all sorts of activities in the book's pages, whether its<strong> sorting mementos</strong>, reassembling <strong>torn up photos,</strong> or solving<strong> gentle logic and word puzzles</strong>\u00a0- the scrapbook is full of surprises! As you uncover the story, you'll also step into Connie's shoes as she relives the past through<strong> unique emotional moments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it wouldn't be scrapbooking without decoration -<strong> unlock new stickers</strong>\u00a0in every chapter and  use them to<strong>\u00a0customise</strong> pages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/75533e27a3f2810caadfbf6298c9d8b6.poster.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/75533e27a3f2810caadfbf6298c9d8b6.webm?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/75533e27a3f2810caadfbf6298c9d8b6.mp4?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/6f8ddfebcb87850ea39c45a47f574e83.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1469 height=165 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Pieced Together offers:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1-2 hours</strong> of light puzzles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A carefully crafted, <strong>poignant story</strong> about life, friendship and getting older </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful <strong>illustrations</strong> and <strong>hand-drawn animations</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stickers</strong> to decorate with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original <strong>acoustic soundtrack</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High quality <strong>voice acting</strong> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It doesn\u2019t offer:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore brain-teasers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-form creative mode</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/5d7457cace8a94ddeab7375332710b5b.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1431 height=528 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/c8689c477fa5c0ebcc2f279e52153407.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1441 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glowfrog Games</strong> is a tiny company of two people, Kate and Ellie, who left the world of free-to-play to make more meaningful games together. Pieced Together is the studio\u2019s first game, built with the help of a talented freelance team. We poured a lot of our personal experiences into the story and its details, and we hope you enjoy playing it as much as we enjoyed making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891370/1624f5052a2829ce44a7384f74bfe46f2cf65c47.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891370/3ac4778ad7154e8b24fe139542cd719f901a9dda.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891370/b091d454f14c3019ee184fe66fa399b70b68ee98.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4 Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2891370/4ae187237513d0df0f0d7bffb6fcb324282fd3aa.jpg"},{"name":"