penning an emotional letter to her former best friend as she goes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Connie needs to decide: does she want to reach out, or is the past best left behind?</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/9d4d472c989bb04a977fc735ee5b0404.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1468 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/ff68c662bd37c45b1208ac92978656cf.poster.avif?t=1772975313\" width=1170 height=442 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/ff68c662bd37c45b1208ac92978656cf.webm?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891370/extras/ff68c662bd37c45b1208ac92978656cf.mp4?t=1772975313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enjoy a variety of scrapbooking activities and light puzzles - every page is unique!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll find yourself doing all sorts of activities in the book's pages, whether its<strong> sorting mementos</strong>, reassembling <strong>torn up photos,</strong> or solving<strong> gentle logic and word puzzles</strong>\u00a0- the scrapbook is full of surprises! As you uncover the story, you'll also step into Connie's shoes as she relives the past through<strong> unique emotional moments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it wouldn't be scrapbooking without decoration -<strong> unlock new stickers</strong>\u00a0in every chapter and  use them to<strong>\u00a0customise</strong> pages!</p><p cla